    'text': 'Patient: hello doctor I am 25 years old I am suffering from fissure for the past one year but it is not healing properly I am using lox oil and stool softener softovac now regularly last time when I consulted a doctor he told me that I am having piles too with warts are now disappearing as I used imiquimod for more than a month but it caused the skin around my anus red little itchy and inflamed please help I am an hiv positive person can I use candid around the anus
