Doctor: hi so the problem here is right ear tinnitus regarding this I need to know is there hearing difficulty in the right ear what type of tinnitus swishing or continuous how long it lasts is there any vertigo associated with tinnitus is there any discharge or fullness of the right ear regarding bursts of light which eye single eye or both eyes at the same time of tinnitus or at a different time are flashes colored or black or white is burning on the back of tongue one sided or both sided is there any redness on the tongue is there coarseness of voice or throat pain please answer all these questions',
