ee and my calf have not gone down I was also told that I have an umbilical hernia and two inguinal hernias I also have a history of localized scleroderma which I understand can weaken the connective tissues and blood vessels recent blood tests for ana and rheumatoid factor both came back negative not sure how that is possible when I was diagnosed with a positive ana and localized scleroderma morphea 25 years ago I am very scared do you have any idea of what is happening to me or what tests I should have done not sure if this is gi related vascular rheumatology etc but I need to find a way to calm these spells so I can go back to work
