    'text': 'Patient: hello doctor in the past several months I was diagnosed with anterior uveitis in my right eye several weeks later I was also diagnosed in my left eye in addition I experienced some achilles heel tendinitis and back pain I completed the week treatment program dilating drops for the first week and slow recession of steroid drops and about weeks later symptoms began reappearing in the left eye followed by the right I began another round of steroid drops in both eyes and slowly tapered the consistency I am down to drops per day and I have begun experiencing severe back pain which had previously quieted down also in the past weeks I have had a pityeariasis rose attack the and attack in 4 years I was also treated for bacterial vaginosis a few weeks ago and prescribed antibiotics it seems to me that everything is connected but I tested negative for inflammation in my blood and no doctor has been able to link everything or look at all my symptoms as a whole any help or input is greatly appreciated
